t\n\n            `<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> in  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> &#x27;. The expression\n\n            `<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&#x27; had been defined", "docsize": 46658, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Punjab-Haryana High Court", "citation": "AIR 2014 (NOC) 58 (P. & H.)"}, {"tid": 1072353, "catids": null, "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2011-01-17", "authorid": null, "bench": [1115, 1425], "title": "Catholic Reformation Literature ... vs Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Board on 17 January, 2011", "numcites": 7, "numcitedby": 1, "headline": "<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>&quot;\n\n  under clause (b) of the Explanation to Sub <b>Section</b> (6) of  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> \n\nspecifically covers <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> for purposes other than ... Regulations, <b>electricity</b> bill raised by the licensee against a\n\nconsumer for <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of\n\nthe Act is specifically excluded from", "docsize": 16648, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court", "citation": "AIR 2011 KERALA 70"}, {"tid": 102232691, "catids": [1], "doctype": 1017, "publishdate": "2013-02-08", "authorid": 853, "bench": [853], "title": "Executive Engineer ( O & M ) vs Paras Ship Breakers Ltd & on 8 February, 2013", "numcites": 6, "numcitedby": 1, "headline": "Gujarat <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003 , and continued to <b>use</b>\n<b>electricity</b> <b>unauthorisedly</b>. Explanation of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n<b>electricity</b> is provided in  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> ... <b>use</b> <b>electricity</b> or supply <b>electricity</b> to\nanyone else. The respondent No.1 was, therefore, booked for resale of\n<b>electricity</b>/<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Section</b>", "docsize": 70292, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Gujarat High Court", "author": "Z K Saiyed", "authorEncoded": "z-k-saiyed"}, {"tid": 82842605, "catids": null, "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2019-02-28", "authorid": null, "bench": [1141, 1106], "title": "The Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Board Ltd vs M/S. Alwaye Rubex (P) Ltd on 28 February, 2019", "numcites": 5, "numcitedby": 1, "headline": "Otherwise, the restriction of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>, which is\n\nthe intention behind  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> , would be rendered otiose.\n\n <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  enables assessment when there ... <b>unauthorised</b>          <b>use</b>     of\n\n<b>electricity</b>.       There        is    absolutely       no   reference         to    such\n\n<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> being in excess of the contract demand.\n\n<b>Unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>", "docsize": 69544, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court"}, {"tid": 38187395, "catids": null, "doctype": 1024, "publishdate": "2026-03-13", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "Rattan Singh vs State Of Haryana And Ors on 13 March, 2026", "numcites": 70, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "during which such\n             <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> has taken place and if,\n             however, the period during which such <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n             <b>electricity</b> has taken place ... <b>Section</b> 135 . At the first blush, it appears that assessment of <b>electricity</b>\n\ncharges can be framed under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  with respect to <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>", "docsize": 140243, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Punjab-Haryana High Court"}, {"tid": 176037461, "catids": null, "doctype": 1019, "publishdate": "2022-12-16", "authorid": 1510, "bench": [1510, 964], "title": "Castron Technologies Ltd vs The Damodar Valley Corporation Through ... on 16 December, 2022", "numcites": 41, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "that the expression\n\u2015<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>\u2016 under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of\nthe 2003 Act deals 